.TH CRUNCH_REBOOT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_reboot \- invokes linux reboot with the required magic values and an optional restart argument
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/reboot.h>
.B int crunch_reboot(unsigned int command, const char* argument);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes Linux reboot with the required magic values and an optional restart argument. This can reboot or power off the system and requires CAP_SYS_BOOT.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reboot (2)
